 It's better to ask one clarifying question than to run multiple expensive queries
 that may not answer what the user actually wanted.
 
+**Ask only about genuine ambiguity — never ask for permission to continue.** A
+clarifying question is for when you cannot tell *what* was asked. It is not a way
